						<div class="col-lg-6">
							<div class="clsPADDING20">
								<h1 class="clsTXT_BLACK" style="padding-top:8%"><b>Marketing Solutions</b> for Your Business</h1>
								<div class="clsPADDING_TOP10"><img src="images/bar1.png" class="img-fluid" width=""/></div>
								<p class="clsTXT_GRAY clsPADDING_TOP20">At E1U Life, we don’t just give you the tools—<b class="clsTXT_BLACK"><i>you get a partner</i></b> committed to your success. We provide an all-in-one platform that includes everything from CRM, email, and SMS marketing to website builders and automated funnels.</p>
								<p class="clsTXT_GRAY clsPADDING_TOP20">Our straightforward training cuts out the fluff, showing you exactly how to drive more leads, close more sales, and <b class="clsTXT_BLACK"><i>grow your business</i></b>.</p>
								<div class="clsPADDING_TOP20"><button onclick="scrollToID('how_to_get')" type="button" class="btn btn-danger btn-lg"><b>Get Started</b></button></div>
							</div>
						</div>
