		<div class="clsBG_WHITE" style="border:1px solid #e0e0e0;">
			<div class="clsPAD_PER_TB4">
				<div class="container">
					<div class="row">
						<div class="col-lg-6">
							<div class="clsPADDING20">
								<h1 class="clsTXT_BLACK" style="padding-top:8%"><b>Creative Challenges</b> are our passion</h1>
								<div class="clsPADDING_TOP10"><img src="images/bar1.png" class="img-fluid" width=""/></div>
								<p class="clsTXT_GRAY clsPADDING_TOP20">If you don't have the time, our team can build and manage your entire marketing system for you. No guesswork, no hassle—just a <b><i>clear path to real results</i></b>.</p>
								<p class="clsTXT_GRAY clsPADDING_TOP20">We're here to do the heavy lifting, so you can focus on what you do best: running your business. With E1U Life, you're not alone in this. We're in your corner, guiding you every step of the way to <b class="clsTXT_BLACK"><i>achieve your goals</i></b>.</p>
								<div class="clsPADDING_TOP20"><button onclick="scrollToID('how_to_get')" type="button" class="btn btn-danger btn-lg"><b>Get Started</b></button></div>
							</div>
